 "query": "I was out walking my golden retriever this morning and he stopped to sniff a whole patch of dandelions that had grown through the cracks in the sidewalk, it was so cute I took a dozen photos to send to my sister. On the way home I popped into the neighborhood bakery and picked up a lemon poppyseed muffin and a lavender latte, the barista even drew a little cat face in the foam on the latte. When I got home I realized the zipper on my favorite canvas tote bag had broken, so I had to rummage around in my closet to find a replacement bag to use for work next week. Now I need to sort out a few order issues: first, I need to return items 8479046075 from order #W8660475, 7824298782 from order #W9218746, and 4900661478 and 3614853563 from order #W6239298, all to the payment method credit_card_2112420. Then for my pending order #W4860251, please update the shipping address to 921 Park Avenue, Suite 892, Chicago, IL 60612, USA, and also change item 5209958006 to item 8964750292, charging the difference to credit_card_2112420.",
